    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "*** A STUNNING THREE BEDROOM (THREE BATHROOM) END OF TERRACE FAMILY HOME, C2 ENERGY RATING, CLOSE TO ALL LOCAL AMENITIES, WALKING DISTANCE TO THE SQUARE SHOPPING CENTRE AND TALLGHT LUAS, GOOD CONDITION THROUGHOUT AND SPACIOUS REAR GARDEN*** \n\nByrne Malone Estate Agents are delighted to present 53 Deerpark Place to the market. This fabulous C-rated family home is ideally located on the highly popular \"Deerpark\" development with a backdrop of The Dublin Mountains. All local amenities are close by (local shops, schools, parks etc) The Square Shopping Centre and Tallaght LUAS are both within walking distance and the N81, N7 and M50 are all just minutes away by car. \n\nThis beautifully presented home offers bright and very spacious living accommodation of approx 951 sq ft that briefly comprises of a sitting room, an open-plan kitchen/diner, three great sized bedrooms with en-suite to main bedroom, a family bathroom and a downstairs cloakroom/W.C. To the rear is a spacious garden and and ample visitor parking to the front. \n\nTo view this exceptional property please call us on 01 912 5500"
      },
